<title>UK: JD Sports makes debut with sales,profit rise.</title>
<headline>JD Sports makes debut with sales,profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.75		   vs 5.47</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.35		   vs 3.57</p>
<p> Turnover		   42.1		   vs 26.3</p>
<p>NOTE - These results are the first as listed company from sportswear retailer John David Sports Plc which came onto the London stock exchange on October 22 last year.</p>
